{"seq":3,"slug":"process-implementation","title":"进程的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/processes/process-implementation","wordCount":1707,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"进程的实现机制\">进程的实现机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>进程的实现围绕四个问题展开：<strong>如何创建</strong>、<strong>如何调度</strong>、<strong>如何通信</strong>、<strong>如何终止</strong>。每一个问题都有多种机制可选，选择本身就是在隔离性、开销与复杂度之间做权衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>关键权衡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>创建</strong></td>\n<td>fork（复制）、spawn/exec（全新）</td>\n<td>fork 靠写时复制（COW）摊薄开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>调度</strong></td>\n<td>FCFS、SJF、优先级、时间片轮转</td>\n<td>吞吐、响应时间、公平性三者难以兼得</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>通信</strong></td>\n<td>管道、消息队列、共享内存、信号量、套接字</td>\n<td>共享内存最快但需同步，套接字可跨网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>终止</strong></td>\n<td>正常退出、信号终止、异常终止</td>\n<td>父进程不 wait 就会留下僵尸进程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  C[&quot;创建&lt;br/&gt;fork / spawn + COW&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;调度&lt;br/&gt;FCFS / SJF / 优先级 / 时间片&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; IPC[&quot;通信&lt;br/&gt;管道 / 消息队列 / 共享内存 / 套接字&quot;]&#10;  IPC --&gt; T[&quot;终止&lt;br/&gt;正常 / 异常 + 资源回收&quot;]\">graph LR\n  C[\"创建&lt;br/&gt;fork / spawn + COW\"] --&gt; S[\"调度&lt;br/&gt;FCFS / SJF / 优先级 / 时间片\"]\n  S --&gt; IPC[\"通信&lt;br/&gt;管道 / 消息队列 / 共享内存 / 套接字\"]\n  IPC --&gt; T[\"终止&lt;br/&gt;正常 / 异常 + 资源回收\"]</pre><p>贯穿四个环节的一条主线是<strong>开销与能力的权衡</strong>：越简单高效的机制（如共享内存、FCFS）往往越缺乏保护，越通用安全的机制（如套接字、抢占式轮转）往往付出更多开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"进程的创建\">进程的创建</h2><p>操作系统提供了多种系统调用来创建新进程。不同的创建方式在语义和效率上各有特点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fork-复制当前进程\">fork — 复制当前进程</h3><p><code>fork</code> 是 UNIX/Linux 系统中最经典的进程创建方式。它会创建一个当前进程的<strong>近乎完全的副本</strong>（子进程），子进程从 <code>fork</code> 调用之后继续执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION fork_example():&#10;    pid = fork()&#10;    IF pid == 0 THEN&#10;        // 子进程：fork 返回 0&#10;        print(&quot;我是子进程，PID =&quot;, getpid())&#10;    ELSE IF pid &gt; 0 THEN&#10;        // 父进程：fork 返回子进程的 PID&#10;        print(&quot;我是父进程，子进程 PID =&quot;, pid)&#10;    ELSE&#10;        // fork 失败&#10;        print(&quot;进程创建失败&quot;)&#10;    END IF&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION fork_example():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pid = fork()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IF pid == 0 THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 子进程：fork 返回 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        print(\"我是子进程，PID =\", getpid())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ELSE IF pid > 0 THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 父进程：fork 返回子进程的 PID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        print(\"我是父进程，子进程 PID =\", pid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ELSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // fork 失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        print(\"进程创建失败\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END IF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[&quot;Parent Process&lt;br/&gt;Calls fork()&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt;|&quot;Copy Address Space&quot;| F{&quot;fork Return Value&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;Returns 0&quot;| C[&quot;Child Process&lt;br/&gt;(New PID)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;Returns Child PID&quot;| PP[&quot;Parent Process Continues&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;Returns -1&quot;| ERR[&quot;Creation Failed&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    P[\"Parent Process&lt;br/&gt;Calls fork()\"]\n    P --&gt;|\"Copy Address Space\"| F{\"fork Return Value\"}\n    F --&gt;|\"Returns 0\"| C[\"Child Process&lt;br/&gt;(New PID)\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"Returns Child PID\"| PP[\"Parent Process Continues\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"Returns -1\"| ERR[\"Creation Failed\"]</pre><h3 id=\"spawn-直接创建新进程\">spawn — 直接创建新进程</h3><p><code>spawn</code>（或 <code>exec</code> 系列调用）直接从指定的可执行文件创建新进程，不需要先复制再替换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION spawn_example():&#10;    // 直接指定程序路径和参数创建新进程&#10;    child_pid = spawn(&quot;/path/to/program&quot;, [&quot;arg1&quot;, &quot;arg2&quot;])&#10;    IF child_pid &gt; 0 THEN&#10;        print(&quot;成功创建子进程，PID =&quot;, child_pid)&#10;        wait(child_pid)  // 等待子进程结束&#10;    END IF&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION spawn_example():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 直接指定程序路径和参数创建新进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    child_pid = spawn(\"/path/to/program\", [\"arg1\", \"arg2\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IF child_pid > 0 THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        print(\"成功创建子进程，PID =\", child_pid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        wait(child_pid)  // 等待子进程结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END IF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"fork-vs-spawn-对比\">fork vs spawn 对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>fork</th>\n<th>spawn / exec</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>创建方式</strong></td>\n<td>复制当前进程的地址空间</td>\n<td>从可执行文件创建全新进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>初始状态</strong></td>\n<td>与父进程几乎相同</td>\n<td>全新的程序映像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>写时复制（COW）</strong></td>\n<td>支持，延迟实际拷贝</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>典型系统</strong></td>\n<td>UNIX / Linux</td>\n<td>Windows（CreateProcess）、POSIX spawn</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>常见用法</strong></td>\n<td>fork + exec 组合</td>\n<td>直接创建新程序进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>性能</strong></td>\n<td>得益于 COW 开销较小</td>\n<td>无需复制父进程状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"写时复制-copy-on-write\">写时复制（Copy-On-Write）</h3><p>现代操作系统在 <code>fork</code> 时并不会立即复制父进程的所有内存页，而是让父子进程<strong>共享</strong>同一份物理内存，仅在某一方尝试<strong>写入</strong>时才真正复制该内存页：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph AFTER_FORK[&quot;After fork (Sharing Phase)&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        PA1[&quot;Parent Page Table&quot;]&#10;        CA1[&quot;Child Page Table&quot;]&#10;        PHY1[&quot;Physical Page (Read-Only Shared)&quot;]&#10;        PA1 --&gt; PHY1&#10;        CA1 --&gt; PHY1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph AFTER_WRITE[&quot;After Child Writes (Copy Phase)&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        PA2[&quot;Parent Page Table&quot;]&#10;        CA2[&quot;Child Page Table&quot;]&#10;        PHY2[&quot;Physical Page A (Parent Process)&quot;]&#10;        PHY3[&quot;Physical Page B (Child Process Copy)&quot;]&#10;        PA2 --&gt; PHY2&#10;        CA2 --&gt; PHY3&#10;    end&#10;    AFTER_FORK --&gt;|&quot;Triggered by Child Write&quot;| AFTER_WRITE\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph AFTER_FORK[\"After fork (Sharing Phase)\"]\n        direction TB\n        PA1[\"Parent Page Table\"]\n        CA1[\"Child Page Table\"]\n        PHY1[\"Physical Page (Read-Only Shared)\"]\n        PA1 --&gt; PHY1\n        CA1 --&gt; PHY1\n    end\n    subgraph AFTER_WRITE[\"After Child Writes (Copy Phase)\"]\n        direction TB\n        PA2[\"Parent Page Table\"]\n        CA2[\"Child Page Table\"]\n        PHY2[\"Physical Page A (Parent Process)\"]\n        PHY3[\"Physical Page B (Child Process Copy)\"]\n        PA2 --&gt; PHY2\n        CA2 --&gt; PHY3\n    end\n    AFTER_FORK --&gt;|\"Triggered by Child Write\"| AFTER_WRITE</pre><h2 id=\"进程调度算法\">进程调度算法</h2><p>操作系统需要决定在多个就绪进程中，下一个让哪个进程使用 CPU。不同的调度算法有不同的目标和适用场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[&quot;Multiple Processes in Ready Queue&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; S{&quot;Scheduling Algorithm Selection&quot;}&#10;    S --&gt;|&quot;First Come First Served&quot;| FCFS[&quot;FCFS&lt;br/&gt;By Arrival Order&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt;|&quot;Shortest Job First&quot;| SJF[&quot;SJF&lt;br/&gt;By Estimated Time&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt;|&quot;Priority Scheduling&quot;| PRI[&quot;Priority&lt;br/&gt;By Priority Level&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt;|&quot;Round-Robin&quot;| RR[&quot;Round-Robin&lt;br/&gt;By Fixed Time Slice&quot;]&#10;    FCFS --&gt; R[&quot;Selected Process&lt;br/&gt;Enters Running State&quot;]&#10;    SJF --&gt; R&#10;    PRI --&gt; R&#10;    RR --&gt; R\">flowchart TD\n    Q[\"Multiple Processes in Ready Queue\"]\n    Q --&gt; S{\"Scheduling Algorithm Selection\"}\n    S --&gt;|\"First Come First Served\"| FCFS[\"FCFS&lt;br/&gt;By Arrival Order\"]\n    S --&gt;|\"Shortest Job First\"| SJF[\"SJF&lt;br/&gt;By Estimated Time\"]\n    S --&gt;|\"Priority Scheduling\"| PRI[\"Priority&lt;br/&gt;By Priority Level\"]\n    S --&gt;|\"Round-Robin\"| RR[\"Round-Robin&lt;br/&gt;By Fixed Time Slice\"]\n    FCFS --&gt; R[\"Selected Process&lt;br/&gt;Enters Running State\"]\n    SJF --&gt; R\n    PRI --&gt; R\n    RR --&gt; R</pre><h3 id=\"先来先服务-fcfs\">先来先服务（FCFS）</h3><p>按照进程到达就绪队列的<strong>先后顺序</strong>进行调度，最先到达的进程最先获得 CPU。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION fcfs_schedule(ready_queue):&#10;    WHILE ready_queue is not empty:&#10;        process = ready_queue.dequeue()  // 取出队首进程&#10;        run(process)                     // 执行直到完成或阻塞&#10;    END WHILE&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION fcfs_schedule(ready_queue):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WHILE ready_queue is not empty:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        process = ready_queue.dequeue()  // 取出队首进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        run(process)                     // 执行直到完成或阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END WHILE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：实现简单，公平。 <strong>缺点</strong>：长作业会阻塞后续短作业（<strong>护航效应</strong>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"最短作业优先-sjf\">最短作业优先（SJF）</h3><p>优先调度预计执行时间最短的进程，以最小化平均等待时间。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION sjf_schedule(ready_queue):&#10;    WHILE ready_queue is not empty:&#10;        process = ready_queue.find_shortest()  // 找到预估时间最短的&#10;        ready_queue.remove(process)&#10;        run(process)&#10;    END WHILE&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION sjf_schedule(ready_queue):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WHILE ready_queue is not empty:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        process = ready_queue.find_shortest()  // 找到预估时间最短的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ready_queue.remove(process)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        run(process)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END WHILE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：平均等待时间最优。 <strong>缺点</strong>：难以准确预估执行时间；长作业可能<strong>饥饿</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优先级调度-priority\">优先级调度（Priority）</h3><p>为每个进程赋予一个优先级数值，调度器选择优先级最高的进程执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION priority_schedule(ready_queue):&#10;    WHILE ready_queue is not empty:&#10;        process = ready_queue.find_highest_priority()&#10;        ready_queue.remove(process)&#10;        run(process)&#10;        // 可选：动态调整其他进程的优先级（老化机制）&#10;        age_waiting_processes(ready_queue)&#10;    END WHILE&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION priority_schedule(ready_queue):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WHILE ready_queue is not empty:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        process = ready_queue.find_highest_priority()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ready_queue.remove(process)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        run(process)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 可选：动态调整其他进程的优先级（老化机制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        age_waiting_processes(ready_queue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END WHILE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：可以根据任务重要性分配资源。 <strong>缺点</strong>：低优先级进程可能<strong>饥饿</strong>（可通过老化机制缓解）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间片轮转-round-robin\">时间片轮转（Round-Robin）</h3><p>每个进程分配一个固定的<strong>时间片（quantum）</strong>，时间片用完后切换到下一个进程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION round_robin_schedule(ready_queue, quantum):&#10;    WHILE ready_queue is not empty:&#10;        process = ready_queue.dequeue()&#10;        run_for(process, quantum)  // 最多执行 quantum 时间&#10;        IF process is not finished THEN&#10;            ready_queue.enqueue(process)  // 放回队尾&#10;        END IF&#10;    END WHILE&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION round_robin_schedule(ready_queue, quantum):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WHILE ready_queue is not empty:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        process = ready_queue.dequeue()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        run_for(process, quantum)  // 最多执行 quantum 时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IF process is not finished THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ready_queue.enqueue(process)  // 放回队尾</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        END IF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END WHILE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：响应时间好，公平。 <strong>缺点</strong>：时间片过大退化为 FCFS，过小则上下文切换开销大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"调度算法对比\">调度算法对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>抢占式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>FCFS</strong></td>\n<td>先到先服务</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>简单公平</td>\n<td>护航效应</td>\n<td>批处理系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>SJF</strong></td>\n<td>最短优先</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>平均等待时间最优</td>\n<td>饥饿、难以预估</td>\n<td>已知作业长度的批处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Priority</strong></td>\n<td>优先级</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>灵活、可区分重要性</td>\n<td>饥饿（需老化）</td>\n<td>实时系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Round-Robin</strong></td>\n<td>时间片轮转</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>响应好、公平</td>\n<td>上下文切换开销</td>\n<td>分时系统、交互式系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"进程间通信-ipc\">进程间通信（IPC）</h2><p>由于进程之间内存空间相互隔离，进程间的数据交换需要借助操作系统提供的**进程间通信（Inter-Process Communication, IPC）**机制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    PA[&quot;Process A&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Write&quot;| PIPE[&quot;Pipe / Message Queue / Shared Memory&quot;]&#10;    PIPE --&gt;|&quot;Read&quot;| PB[&quot;Process B&quot;]&#10;    PA --&gt;|&quot;Send&quot;| SOCK[&quot;Socket&quot;]&#10;    SOCK --&gt;|&quot;Receive&quot;| PB&#10;    PA --&gt;|&quot;Signal&quot;| SIG[&quot;Semaphore&quot;]&#10;    SIG --&gt;|&quot;Synchronize&quot;| PB\">flowchart LR\n    PA[\"Process A\"] --&gt;|\"Write\"| PIPE[\"Pipe / Message Queue / Shared Memory\"]\n    PIPE --&gt;|\"Read\"| PB[\"Process B\"]\n    PA --&gt;|\"Send\"| SOCK[\"Socket\"]\n    SOCK --&gt;|\"Receive\"| PB\n    PA --&gt;|\"Signal\"| SIG[\"Semaphore\"]\n    SIG --&gt;|\"Synchronize\"| PB</pre><h3 id=\"管道-pipe\">管道（Pipe）</h3><p>管道是最简单的 IPC 机制，提供一个<strong>单向的字节流通道</strong>。数据从一端写入，从另一端读出。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION pipe_example():&#10;    (read_end, write_end) = create_pipe()&#10;&#10;    pid = fork()&#10;    IF pid == 0 THEN&#10;        // 子进程：从管道读取&#10;        close(write_end)&#10;        data = read(read_end)&#10;        print(&quot;子进程收到:&quot;, data)&#10;    ELSE&#10;        // 父进程：向管道写入&#10;        close(read_end)&#10;        write(write_end, &quot;Hello from parent!&quot;)&#10;    END IF&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION pipe_example():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (read_end, write_end) = create_pipe()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pid = fork()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IF pid == 0 THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 子进程：从管道读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        close(write_end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data = read(read_end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        print(\"子进程收到:\", data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ELSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 父进程：向管道写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        close(read_end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        write(write_end, \"Hello from parent!\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END IF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"消息队列-message-queue\">消息队列（Message Queue）</h3><p>消息队列允许进程以<strong>结构化的消息</strong>为单位进行通信，支持按类型选择性接收。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION message_queue_example():&#10;    queue = create_message_queue(key)&#10;&#10;    // 发送方&#10;    message = { type: 1, content: &quot;任务数据&quot; }&#10;    send(queue, message)&#10;&#10;    // 接收方&#10;    received = receive(queue, type: 1)&#10;    print(&quot;收到消息:&quot;, received.content)&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION message_queue_example():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    queue = create_message_queue(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 发送方</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    message = { type: 1, content: \"任务数据\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    send(queue, message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 接收方</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    received = receive(queue, type: 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print(\"收到消息:\", received.content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"共享内存-shared-memory\">共享内存（Shared Memory）</h3><p>共享内存是效率最高的 IPC 方式——两个进程将同一块物理内存映射到各自的地址空间中，直接读写即可。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph SHM_MODEL[&quot;Shared Memory Model&quot;]&#10;        direction LR&#10;        PA2[&quot;Process A&lt;br/&gt;Virtual Address Space&quot;]&#10;        SHM[&quot;Shared Memory Region&lt;br/&gt;(Physical Memory)&quot;]&#10;        PB2[&quot;Process B&lt;br/&gt;Virtual Address Space&quot;]&#10;        PA2 --&gt;|&quot;Map&quot;| SHM&#10;        PB2 --&gt;|&quot;Map&quot;| SHM&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph SHM_MODEL[\"Shared Memory Model\"]\n        direction LR\n        PA2[\"Process A&lt;br/&gt;Virtual Address Space\"]\n        SHM[\"Shared Memory Region&lt;br/&gt;(Physical Memory)\"]\n        PB2[\"Process B&lt;br/&gt;Virtual Address Space\"]\n        PA2 --&gt;|\"Map\"| SHM\n        PB2 --&gt;|\"Map\"| SHM\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION shared_memory_example():&#10;    shm = create_shared_memory(size: 4096)&#10;&#10;    pid = fork()&#10;    IF pid == 0 THEN&#10;        // 子进程：读取共享内存&#10;        attach(shm)&#10;        data = read_from(shm)&#10;        print(&quot;子进程读到:&quot;, data)&#10;    ELSE&#10;        // 父进程：写入共享内存&#10;        attach(shm)&#10;        write_to(shm, &quot;共享数据&quot;)&#10;        wait(pid)&#10;    END IF&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION shared_memory_example():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shm = create_shared_memory(size: 4096)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pid = fork()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IF pid == 0 THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 子进程：读取共享内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        attach(shm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data = read_from(shm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        print(\"子进程读到:\", data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ELSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 父进程：写入共享内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        attach(shm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        write_to(shm, \"共享数据\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        wait(pid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END IF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"信号量-semaphore\">信号量（Semaphore）</h3><p>信号量主要用于<strong>同步和互斥</strong>，控制多个进程对共享资源的访问顺序。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION semaphore_example():&#10;    sem = create_semaphore(initial_value: 1)&#10;&#10;    // 进程 A&#10;    wait(sem)           // P 操作：信号量减 1，若为负则阻塞&#10;    // 进入临界区，访问共享资源&#10;    access_shared_resource()&#10;    signal(sem)         // V 操作：信号量加 1，唤醒等待者&#10;&#10;    // 进程 B&#10;    wait(sem)           // 若进程 A 还在临界区，进程 B 将在此阻塞&#10;    access_shared_resource()&#10;    signal(sem)&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION semaphore_example():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sem = create_semaphore(initial_value: 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 进程 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wait(sem)           // P 操作：信号量减 1，若为负则阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 进入临界区，访问共享资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    access_shared_resource()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    signal(sem)         // V 操作：信号量加 1，唤醒等待者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 进程 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wait(sem)           // 若进程 A 还在临界区，进程 B 将在此阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    access_shared_resource()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    signal(sem)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"套接字-socket\">套接字（Socket）</h3><p>套接字是最通用的 IPC 机制，不仅支持同一台机器上的进程通信，还支持<strong>跨网络</strong>的进程通信。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 服务端&#10;FUNCTION socket_server():&#10;    server = create_socket(port: 8080)&#10;    bind(server)&#10;    listen(server)&#10;    client = accept(server)&#10;    data = receive(client)&#10;    send(client, &quot;收到: &quot; + data)&#10;&#10;// 客户端&#10;FUNCTION socket_client():&#10;    client = create_socket()&#10;    connect(client, &quot;localhost&quot;, 8080)&#10;    send(client, &quot;Hello!&quot;)&#10;    response = receive(client)&#10;    print(response)&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 服务端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION socket_server():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    server = create_socket(port: 8080)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bind(server)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listen(server)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    client = accept(server)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data = receive(client)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    send(client, \"收到: \" + data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION socket_client():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    client = create_socket()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    connect(client, \"localhost\", 8080)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    send(client, \"Hello!\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    response = receive(client)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print(response)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ipc-机制对比\">IPC 机制对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>IPC 方式</th>\n<th>通信方向</th>\n<th>数据格式</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>是否跨网络</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>管道</strong></td>\n<td>单向（命名管道可双向）</td>\n<td>字节流</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>父子进程简单通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>消息队列</strong></td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>结构化消息</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>按类型分发消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>共享内存</strong></td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td><strong>最快</strong></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高（需同步）</td>\n<td>大数据量高频通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>信号量</strong></td>\n<td>同步信号</td>\n<td>无数据</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>同步与互斥控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>套接字</strong></td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>字节流/数据报</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td><strong>是</strong></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>网络通信、跨机器 IPC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"进程的终止\">进程的终止</h2><p>进程终止分为<strong>正常终止</strong>和<strong>异常终止</strong>两种情况。</p>\n<h3 id=\"正常终止\">正常终止</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION normal_exit():&#10;    // 方式 1：main 函数返回&#10;    return 0&#10;&#10;    // 方式 2：主动调用退出&#10;    exit(0)         // 正常退出，返回码 0&#10;&#10;    // 方式 3：最后一个线程完成&#10;    // 进程中所有线程执行完毕后自动终止&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION normal_exit():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 方式 1：main 函数返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 方式 2：主动调用退出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    exit(0)         // 正常退出，返回码 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 方式 3：最后一个线程完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 进程中所有线程执行完毕后自动终止</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"异常终止\">异常终止</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"FUNCTION abnormal_exit():&#10;    // 方式 1：收到致命信号&#10;    // 如 SIGSEGV（段错误）、SIGKILL（强制杀死）&#10;&#10;    // 方式 2：未捕获的异常&#10;    THROW uncaught_exception&#10;&#10;    // 方式 3：调用 abort&#10;    abort()         // 异常终止，产生 core dump&#10;END FUNCTION\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION abnormal_exit():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 方式 1：收到致命信号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 如 SIGSEGV（段错误）、SIGKILL（强制杀死）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 方式 2：未捕获的异常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    THROW uncaught_exception</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 方式 3：调用 abort</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abort()         // 异常终止，产生 core dump</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>END FUNCTION</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"终止后的资源回收\">终止后的资源回收</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    T[&quot;Process Termination&quot;] --&gt; S1[&quot;Close All Open File Descriptors&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2[&quot;Release Allocated Memory&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3[&quot;Release Occupied I/O Devices&quot;]&#10;    S3 --&gt; S4[&quot;Send SIGCHLD Signal to Parent Process&quot;]&#10;    S4 --&gt; S5{&quot;Did Parent Call wait?&quot;}&#10;    S5 --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| S6[&quot;Reclaim PCB, Process Fully Removed&quot;]&#10;    S5 --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| S7[&quot;Enter Zombie State&lt;br/&gt;PCB Remains&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    T[\"Process Termination\"] --&gt; S1[\"Close All Open File Descriptors\"]\n    S1 --&gt; S2[\"Release Allocated Memory\"]\n    S2 --&gt; S3[\"Release Occupied I/O Devices\"]\n    S3 --&gt; S4[\"Send SIGCHLD Signal to Parent Process\"]\n    S4 --&gt; S5{\"Did Parent Call wait?\"}\n    S5 --&gt;|\"Yes\"| S6[\"Reclaim PCB, Process Fully Removed\"]\n    S5 --&gt;|\"No\"| S7[\"Enter Zombie State&lt;br/&gt;PCB Remains\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>终止类型</th>\n<th>返回码</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>后续处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>正常退出</strong></td>\n<td>0（成功）或自定义值</td>\n<td>return / exit</td>\n<td>父进程通过 wait 获取返回码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>信号终止</strong></td>\n<td>128 + 信号编号</td>\n<td>kill / 异常信号</td>\n<td>可能生成 core dump</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>异常终止</strong></td>\n<td>非零</td>\n<td>abort / 未捕获异常</td>\n<td>操作系统强制回收资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>进程创建有两种主要方式：<code>fork</code>（复制当前进程）和 <code>spawn</code>（创建全新进程），现代系统通过<strong>写时复制</strong>优化 fork 的性能。</li>\n<li>操作系统通过调度算法（FCFS、SJF、优先级、时间片轮转）决定哪个进程获得 CPU，不同算法在公平性、响应时间和吞吐量之间做出不同权衡。</li>\n<li>进程间通信（IPC）提供了多种机制（管道、消息队列、共享内存、信号量、套接字），从简单到复杂，从本地到网络，满足不同的通信需求。</li>\n<li>进程终止后，操作系统负责回收其资源，父进程应通过 <code>wait</code> 调用回收子进程的状态信息，避免产生僵尸进程。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"进程的实现机制","id":"进程的实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"进程的创建","id":"进程的创建"},{"level":3,"text":"fork — 复制当前进程","id":"fork-复制当前进程"},{"level":3,"text":"spawn — 直接创建新进程","id":"spawn-直接创建新进程"},{"level":3,"text":"fork vs spawn 对比","id":"fork-vs-spawn-对比"},{"level":3,"text":"写时复制（Copy-On-Write）","id":"写时复制-copy-on-write"},{"level":2,"text":"进程调度算法","id":"进程调度算法"},{"level":3,"text":"先来先服务（FCFS）","id":"先来先服务-fcfs"},{"level":3,"text":"最短作业优先（SJF）","id":"最短作业优先-sjf"},{"level":3,"text":"优先级调度（Priority）","id":"优先级调度-priority"},{"level":3,"text":"时间片轮转（Round-Robin）","id":"时间片轮转-round-robin"},{"level":3,"text":"调度算法对比","id":"调度算法对比"},{"level":2,"text":"进程间通信（IPC）","id":"进程间通信-ipc"},{"level":3,"text":"管道（Pipe）","id":"管道-pipe"},{"level":3,"text":"消息队列（Message Queue）","id":"消息队列-message-queue"},{"level":3,"text":"共享内存（Shared Memory）","id":"共享内存-shared-memory"},{"level":3,"text":"信号量（Semaphore）","id":"信号量-semaphore"},{"level":3,"text":"套接字（Socket）","id":"套接字-socket"},{"level":3,"text":"IPC 机制对比","id":"ipc-机制对比"},{"level":2,"text":"进程的终止","id":"进程的终止"},{"level":3,"text":"正常终止","id":"正常终止"},{"level":3,"text":"异常终止","id":"异常终止"},{"level":3,"text":"终止后的资源回收","id":"终止后的资源回收"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"进程的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/processes/process-core-ideas"},"next":{"title":"线程的定义与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/threads/thread-definition-and-concepts"}}